From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Umair Ahmed Shah <umairahmedshah@hotmail.com>
Date: Fri, 17 Apr 2026 21:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: rzg2l-smarc-som: align QSPI fip partition to 0x20000

TF-A reads the FIP from the SPI ROM XIP window at:
  RZG2L_SPIROM_FIP_BASE = SPIROM_BASE + 0x20000 = flash byte 0x20000

The previous fip MTD partition started at 0x1D000, so flashcp /dev/mtd1
wrote the FIP at flash 0x1D000 while BL2 looked at 0x20000 — a 12KB
misalignment causing:
  ERROR: BL2: Failed to load image id 3 (-2)

Note: eSD FIP (RZG2L_SD_FIP_BASE = 0x20000) was always correct; only
QSPI was affected.

Fix: extend bl2 partition to 128KB (0x20000) — well above the 60KB
bl2_bp_spi.bin — and start fip at 0x20000.  After this change
flashcp /dev/mtd1 lands the FIP at the address TF-A expects.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [board-specific fixup for RZ/V2L QSPI boot]

---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/renesas/rzg2l-smarc-som.dtsi | 6 +++---
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/renesas/rzg2l-smarc-som.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/renesas/rzg2l-smarc-som.dtsi
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/renesas/rzg2l-smarc-som.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/renesas/rzg2l-smarc-som.dtsi
@@ -382,11 +382,11 @@
 			partition@0 {
 				label = "bl2";
-				reg = <0x00000000 0x0001d000>;
+				reg = <0x00000000 0x00020000>;
 			};

-			partition@1d000 { /* fip is at offset 0x200 */
+			partition@20000 {
 				label = "fip";
-				reg = <0x0001d000 0x1fe3000>;
+				reg = <0x00020000 0x1fe0000>;
 			};

 			partition@2000000 {
